": 2019, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 289928, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc67pk.jpg"}, {"id": 289931, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc67pn.jpg"}, {"id": 289932, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc67po.jpg"}, {"id": 289929, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc67pl.jpg"}, {"id": 289930, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc67pm.jpg"}, {"id": 289927, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc67pj.jpg"}], "slug": "pokemon-sword", "storyline": "A young trainer in the Galar region receives their first Pok\u00e9mon from Leon, the undefeated Champion of the Galar League and older brother to their best friend Hop. Endorsed to take on the Gym Challenge, the player and Hop set out across Galar to earn eight badges and prove themselves worthy of facing Leon in the Champion Cup. Along the way, they encounter rival challengers, the rowdy fan group Team Yell, and the powerful chairman Rose, who oversees both the League and the region's energy corporation.\n\nWhile pursuing the Gym Challenge, the player uncovers a deeper mystery tied to an ancient catastrophe known as the Darkest Day and two legendary Pok\u00e9mon said to have saved Galar from it long ago. As Rose's ambitions threaten to unleash this power again, the player must confront forces far beyond a simple tournament.", "summary": "A turn-based role-playing game set in the Galar region, a fictional land inspired by the United Kingdom. Players catch, train, and battle creatures called Pok\u00e9mon while traveling across the region to collect eight Gym badges and ultimately challenge the reigning Champion. The game introduces the Dynamax and Gigantamax mechanics, which temporarily transform Pok\u00e9mon into giant forms with enhanced attacks. A fully explorable open-world Wild Area connects major locations, with weather-dependent Pok\u00e9mon encounters and cooperative raid battles for up to four players. The first mainline Pok\u00e9mon entry on the Nintendo Switch, it notably adopted DLC expansions instead of the series' traditional enhanced re-releases.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pokemon-sword", "videos": [{"id": 14535, "name": "E3 2017 Developer Announcement", "video_id": "FLwYM8IYcUs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FLwYM8IYcUs", "title": "Pok\u00e9mon RPG's coming to Switch - E3 2017 HD", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FLwYM8IYcUs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 25185, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "BdA22Lh6Rwk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BdA22Lh6Rwk", "title": "Forge a Path to Greatness in Pok\u00e9mon Sword and Pok\u00e9mon Shield! \u2694 \ud83d\udee1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BdA22Lh6Rwk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 30197, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "71uqwpcwDc0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=71uqwpcwDc0", "title": "UK: Meet Sirfetch\u2019d in Pok\u00e9mon Sword!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/71uqwpcwDc0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 29971, "name": "Meet Sirfetch\u2019d in Pok\u00e9mon Sword! \u2694\ufe0f", "video_id": "5jqSOk89788", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5jqSOk89788", "title": "Meet Sirfetch\u2019d in Pok\u00e9mon Sword! \u2694\ufe0f", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5jqSOk89788/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 27747, "name": "Get Ready for Dynamax in Pok\u00e9mon Sword and Pok\u00e9mon Shield! \u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f", "video_id": "p_dgvgpC8Nw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p_dgvgpC8Nw", "title": "Get Ready for Dynamax in Pok\u00e9mon Sword\u00a0and Pok\u00e9mon Shield! \u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/p_dgvgpC8Nw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 30034, "name": "Camp like never before in Pok\u00e9mon Sword and Pok\u00e9mon Shield!", "video_id": "OMyNNgSVgEY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OMyNNgSVgEY", "title": "Camp 